-case-link\">\n              <h3 class=\"mpa-case-title\">{{ article.title }}</h3>\n            </a>\n\n            <p class=\"mpa-case-excerpt\">\n              {{ article.excerpt | strip_html | truncate: 120 }}\n            </p>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      {% endif %}\n    {% endfor %}\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
