      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#0f172a,#020617);position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n  <!-- subtle glow -->\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-100px;left:-100px;width:300px;height:300px;background:#2563eb;opacity:0.15;filter:blur(120px);border-radius:50%;\"></div>\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:-120px;right:-100px;width:300px;height:300px;background:#ff3b30;opacity:0.15;filter:blur(120px);border-radius:50%;\"></div>\n\n  <div style=\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;position:relative;z-index:2;\">\n\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:32px;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n      HOW YOU CAN HELP\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"color:#9ca3af;margin-bottom:40px;font-size:16px;\">\n      Every action matters. A single share or sighting could help bring someone home.\n    </p>\n\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:24px;\">\n\n      <!-- CARD 1 -->\n      <div style=\"\n        background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0f172a,#020617);\n        border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n        border-radius:18px;\n        padding:26px;\n        text-align:left;\n        transition:all 0.25s ease;\n        position:relative;\n        overflow:hidden;\n      \"\n      onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-8px) scale(1.02)';this.style.boxShadow='0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)'\"\n      onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='none';this.style.boxShadow='none'\">\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px;\">🔁</div>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;\">\n          SHARE ALERTS\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">\n          Sharing missing person posts massively increases reach. The right person seeing it at the right time can change everything.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- CARD 2 -->\n      <div style=\"\n        background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0f172a,#020617);\n        border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n        border-radius:18px;\n        padding:26px;\n        text-align:left;\n        transition:all 0.25s ease;\n        position:relative;\n        overflow:hidden;\n      \"\n      onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-8px) scale(1.02)';this.style.boxShadow='0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)'\"\n      onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='none';this.style.boxShadow='none'\">\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px;\">📍</div>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;\">\n          REPORT SIGHTINGS\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">\n          If you see something, report it immediately. Even small details can help authorities piece together movements.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- CARD 3 -->\n      <div style=\"\n        background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0f172a,#020617);\n        border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n        border-radius:18px;\n        padding:26px;\n        text-align:left;\n        transition:all 0.25s ease;\n        position:relative;\n        overflow:hidden;\n      \"\n      onmouseover=\"this.style.transform='translateY(-8px) scale(1.02)';this.style.boxShadow='0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)'\"\n      onmouseout=\"this.style.transform='none';this.style.boxShadow='none'\">\n\n        <div style=\"font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px;\">👀</div>\n\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;\">\n          STAY AWARE\n        </h3>\n\n        <p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;\">\n          Stay updated on cases near you. Awareness increases the chances of recognition in public places.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
